---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OptimizedImage from '../../components/OptimizedImage.astro';

const title = "Sac Şekillendirme | TARGET MAKİNA";
const description = "";
const keywords = "Telerezyon, İzmir Telerezyon, CNC 5 Eksen, Mastar İmalatı, Fikstür İmalatı, Talaşlı İmalat, Hassas Talaşlı imalat";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <section class="page-hero">
<div class="hero-bg"><OptimizedImage alt="Sac Şekillendirme" src="assets/images/sac/hero_new.png"/></div>
<div class="hero-overlay"></div>
<div class="container hero-content">
<p class="breadcrumb-nav"><a href="/">Ana Sayfa</a> » <a href="/hizmetler/">Hizmetler</a> » Sac Şekillendirme</p>
<h1>Sac Şekillendirme<br/><span>(Sheet Metal) Hizmetleri</span></h1>
<p class="hero-desc">Lazer kesim, abkant büküm ve lazer kaynak yöntemleriyle sac metal parçalarınızı kusursuz şekillendiriyoruz.</p>
<a class="hero-cta" href="/iletisim/">Teklif Al →</a>
</div>
</section>
<section class="stats-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">Lazer</div><div class="stat-label">Kesim Teknolojisi</div></div></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">Abkant</div><div class="stat-label">Hassas Büküm</div></div></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">Kaynak</div><div class="stat-label">Lazer ve TIG/MIG</div></div></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">Hızlı</div><div class="stat-label">Prototipleme</div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="intro-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="row align-items-center">
<div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-2 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
<div class="intro-image"><OptimizedImage alt="Sac Şekillendirme" src="assets/images/sac/intro_new.png"/></div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-1">
<span class="section-tag">Hakkında</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Sac Şekillendirme Nedir?</h2>
<p class="section-desc">Sac şekillendirme (Sheet Metal Fabrication); düz metal levhaların lazerle kesilip, kıvrılıp, kaynatılarak üç boyutlu muhafazalar, braketler ve parçalara dönüştürülmesi işlemidir. Elektronik, otomasyon, otomotiv ve makina şaseleri için idealdir.</p>
<ul class="check-list">
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Fiber Lazer Kesim ile pürüzsüz kenarlar</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>CNC Abkant pres ile yüksek doğrulukta açılı büküm</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Paslanmaz çelik, alüminyum, DKP ve HRP saclar</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Pem somun, civata çakma ve punta kaynak</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Toz boya ve eloksal dahil tam yüzey kaplama</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="caps-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-5"><span class="section-tag">Kabiliyetler</span><h2 class="section-title">Sac İşleme Adımlarımız</h2></div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a1a,#2a2a2a)"><span class="bg-icon">⚙</span><h3 style="color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:22px;position:relative;z-index:2">Lazer Kesim</h3></div><div class="cap-body"><p>Metal plakaları istenilen profillerde, fireyi en aza indirecek nesting (yerleşim) programlarıyla kesiyoruz.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C93715,#a02e12)"><span class="bg-icon">⚙</span><h3 style="color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:22px;position:relative;z-index:2">Abkant Büküm</h3></div><div class="cap-body"><p>Kesilen levhaları CNC abkant tezgahlarımızda mikronluk açı hassasiyetiyle kıvırarak form veriyoruz.</p></div></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6"><div class="cap-card"><div class="cap-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111,#000)"><span class="bg-icon">⚙</span><h3 style="color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:22px;position:relative;z-index:2">Kaynak ve Boya</h3></div><div class="cap-body"><p>Lazer veya TIG/MIG kaynak yöntemleriyle birleştirip, taşlayarak toz boya pürüzsüzlüğüne hazırlıyoruz.</p></div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="page-cta">
<div class="container">
<h2>Sac Kutu veya Şase İhtiyacınız mı Var?</h2>
<p>2D (DXF) veya 3D dosyalarınızı gönderin, kısa sürede fiyatlandıralım.</p>
<a class="cta-btn" href="/iletisim/">Hemen Teklif Al</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :root{--brand:#C93715;--brand-light:rgba(201,55,21,0.1);--dark:#1a1a1a;--text:#555;--title:#222}
        .page-hero{position:relative;height:450px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center}
        .page-hero .hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0}
        .page-hero .hero-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
        .page-hero .hero-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 60%,transparent 100%);z-index:1}
        .page-hero .hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;color:#fff}
        .page-hero h1{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:15px;font-family:var(--title-font-family);line-height:1.2}
        .page-hero h1 span{color:var(--brand)}
        .page-hero .hero-desc{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;opacity:0.85;max-width:550px;margin-bottom:25px}
        .page-hero .breadcrumb-nav{font-size:14px;opacity:0.6}
        .page-hero .breadcrumb-nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
        .hero-cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:14px 35px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s;font-size:15px}
        .hero-cta:hover{background:#a02e12;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(201,55,21,0.4);color:#fff}
        .section-tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);padding:6px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:15px}
        .section-title{font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:var(--title);margin-bottom:20px;font-family:var(--title-font-family);line-height:1.3}
        .section-desc{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text);max-width:700px}
        .intro-section{padding:80px 0}
        .intro-image{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
        .intro-image img{width:100%;height:450px;object-fit:cover;display:block}
        .check-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:25px 0 0}
        .check-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6}
        .check-list li .ico{color:var(--brand);font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}
        .caps-section{padding:80px 0;background:#f8f8f8}
        .cap-card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);transition:all 0.3s;margin-bottom:30px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;height:100%}
        .cap-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(201,55,21,0.12);border-color:rgba(201,55,21,0.2)}
        .cap-card .cap-visual{height:160px;background:var(--dark);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
        .cap-card .cap-visual .bg-icon{font-size:72px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);position:absolute;right:20px;bottom:-10px}
        .cap-card .cap-body{padding:25px 20px}
        .cap-card h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:var(--title);margin-bottom:12px}
        .cap-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text);margin:0}
        .page-cta{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand) 0%,#e04a28 100%);padding:60px 0;text-align:center;color:#fff}
        .page-cta h2{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;font-family:var(--title-font-family)}
        .page-cta p{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:0.9}
        .page-cta .cta-btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);padding:15px 45px;border-radius:30px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s}
        .page-cta .cta-btn:hover{background:var(--dark);color:#fff}
        .stats-section{padding:60px 0;background:var(--dark);color:#fff}
        .stat-box{text-align:center;padding:20px}
        .stat-number{font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand);font-family:var(--title-font-family)}
        .stat-label{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-top:5px}
        @media(max-width:768px){.page-hero{height:350px}.page-hero h1{font-size:28px}.section-title{font-size:24px}.intro-image img{height:280px}.stat-number{font-size:36px}}
</style>
